      "summary": "ការទប់ស្កាត់ការស្ទះ Event Loop (Blocking the Event Loop)៖\n\n- **Common Blockers**៖ ការប្រើ Synchronous APIs (`fs.readFileSync`), ការ Parse JSON ធំៗ, និង ReDoS Vulnerable Regexes។\n- **ផលប៉ះពាល់ធ្ងន់ធ្ងរ**៖ នៅពេល Main Thread ជាប់រវល់ រាល់ Incoming Requests ទាំងអស់ត្រូវគាំងរង់ចាំ។\n- **ដំណោះស្រាយ**៖ ប្រើ Asynchronous Methods, បំបែក Large Computations, ឬប្រើ Worker Threads សម្រាប់ CPU-heavy Tasks។",
      "tip": "Never use synchronous methods (`readFileSync`, `crypto.pbkdf2Sync`, `bcrypt.hashSync`) inside Express request handlers in production.",
      "objective": "Diagnose and prevent Event Loop starvation caused by synchronous operations.",
      "expectedOutcome": "Non-blocking codebase keeping the main thread free to handle concurrent requests.",
      "codeSnippet": "// DANGEROUS: Blocks the entire server for all concurrent users!\napp.get(\"/bad\", (req, res) => {\n  const data = fs.readFileSync(\"/huge-file.csv\"); // Event loop BLOCKED!\n  res.send(data);\n});\n\n// PROPER: Non-blocking asynchronous I/O allows thousands of concurrent requests\napp.get(\"/good\", async (req, res) => {\n  const data = await fs.promises.readFile(\"/huge-file.csv\"); // Event loop stays FREE!\n  res.send(data);\n});"
