      "type": "lab",
      "codeLanguage": "javascript",
      "summary": "ការបង្កើត Express Cache Middleware ជាមួយ Redis៖\n\n- **Dynamic Cache Keys**៖ បង្កើត Key ផ្អែកលើ Request URL (ឧ. `cache:courses:page=1:limit=10`)។\n- **Cache Hit Fast-path**៖ ឆ្លើយតប Cached JSON ត្រឡប់ទៅ Client ភ្លាមៗក្រោម 5ms ដោយមិនប៉ះពាល់ Database។\n- **Automatic Capture**៖ ចាប់យក JSON Response ដោយប្រើ Monkey-patching លើ `res.json` ដើម្បី Save ចូល Redis ពេល Cache Miss។",
      "tip": "Use `req.originalUrl` as the Redis cache key so query parameters (e.g. `?page=1&limit=10`) are preserved in distinct cache entries.",
      "objective": "Construct an Express caching middleware that automatically intercepts and caches responses.",
      "expectedOutcome": "Dramatic response time reduction from ~150ms to ~2ms for cached endpoints.",
      "codeSnippet": "// middleware/cache.js\nimport { redis } from \"../config/redis.js\";\n\nexport const cache = (durationInSeconds = 300) => async (req, res, next) => {\n  if (req.method !== \"GET\") return next();\n\n  const key = `cache:${req.originalUrl}`;\n  try {\n    const cachedData = await redis.get(key);\n    if (cachedData) {\n      return res.status(200).json(JSON.parse(cachedData));\n    }\n\n    // Intercept res.json to capture response before sending\n    const originalJson = res.json.bind(res);\n    res.json = (body) => {\n      // Store in Redis with TTL\n      redis.set(key, JSON.stringify(body), \"EX\", durationInSeconds);\n      return originalJson(body);\n    };\n\n    next();\n  } catch (err) {\n    next(); // On cache failure, gracefully proceed to database\n  }\n};"
